{"id":"d_main_15af_01","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch15","label":"Chapter 15 · Luck"},"label":"Investment Results","stage":null,"prev":"d_main_15_07_e","next":"d_main_15af_02","speakers":{"Narration":"Narration","rupee":"Rupee","Self":"Commander","dolla":"Dolla","yan":"Yan","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi"},"icons":{"Narration":"si_c999_00_s","rupee":"si_c200_00_s","dolla":"si_c202_00_s","yan":"si_c201_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_15af_01_1","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_1","text":"... Soon after, the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City_d","bgArt":"city_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_shopperholic","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_2","text":"Ta-da!! When Talentum and Counters come together, it's double trouble! We went through quite the ordeal, but we're back at the Ark!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["anis","rapi","neon","rupee","dolla","yan"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_3","text":"Whew, I almost thought we wouldn't make it back!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_4","text":"The surface isn't exactly the most welcoming place! Hehe","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_5","text":"On that note, I would like to thank the oh-so-handsome Sweetie and their colleagues for everything they're doing to help us reclaim the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_6","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_6","text":"No problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_7","text":"All right then! Now where were we...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_8","text":"I'm sure you're all positively spazzing out wondering what special treasures we brought back from the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_9","text":"We wanted to share this moment with everyone, so we haven't shown each other what we picked out either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_10","text":"The time has come for the big reveal!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_11","text":"First up, we'll unveil the treasure Talentum managed to take back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_12","text":"Then we'll move onto the Commander and the Counters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_13","text":"First up, we have Dolla!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_14","text":"Weight was a big thing I took into account, so I grabbed some chips first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_15","text":"And more...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_16","text":"This thingamajig that looks like a half-eaten apple.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_17","text":"I just felt this strange attraction to it. Maybe because I'm an electronics operator?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_18","text":"I tried to take anything related to Goddesium.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_19","text":"Goddesium can be added to all kinds of products. I thought it would be helpful for future R&D.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_20","text":"As for me, I brought back a limited-edition luxury handbag made before the first invasion, and a luxury watch that was produced around the same time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_21","text":"If we auction it off on Royal Road, I'm sure it'll fetch a pretty penny!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_22","text":"Moving on...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_23","text":"We have the squad that's the talk of the town, the Counters! Let's check out their haul, shall we?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_24","text":"To be honest, I can't really tell what was what.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_25","text":"I just grabbed some Rapture cores.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_26","text":"The labs would probably pay through the nose for it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_27","text":"Well... erm... sorry to say, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_28","text":"I believe that's just iron.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_29","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_30","text":"If it was a Rapture core,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_31","text":"there would be some sort of power source, along with some distinctive patterns.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_32","text":"This one has nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_33","text":"What about mine?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_34","text":"It's a high-tech, ultra-compact rocket that is fired off during weddings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_35","text":"Pyrotechnics that are only set off when true love is in bloom...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_36","text":"How romantic!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_37","text":"Are you talking about fireworks?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_38","text":"Yes, that's it!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_39","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_40","text":"How about Rapi?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_41","text":"I brought some data chips too, but","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_42","text":"I think I lost them during the battle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_43","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_43","text":"I've got a piece of paper that's torn up.","jump":"d_main_15af_01_45","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_44","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_44","text":"...","jump":"d_main_15af_01_45","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_45","text":"What is with you guys?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_46","text":"Do you guys even want to make money?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_47","text":"Hehe... Seems like things are getting a little tense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_48","text":"Sure, your main job was to escort us, but come on!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_49","text":"That's all for today's stream!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"dolla","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_50","text":"Why did you even bother coming up to the surface?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_51","text":"Remember to follow me, and don't forget to click like and subscribe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"yan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_52","text":"What a bunch of freeloaders! Maybe we should just take their half of the loot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_15af_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rupee","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_15af_01_53","text":"See you all at the next stream!","jump":null,"exit":